VERSION 2
RULE network.server-side-request-forgery VERSION 1
IN DATA_FLOW
LET input BE VARIABLE MATCHES input.untrusted-url
LET sink BE CALL MATCHES network.outbound-request
WHEN input FLOWS TO sink
REQUIRE NOT policy.destination-allowlist input
REPORT "Server-Side Request Forgery Review"
SEVERITY CRITICAL
CONFIDENCE FROM EVIDENCE
WITH TRACE
